<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Domain Access Map — Convert Marketing</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --purple-50: #EEEDFE;
    --purple-200: #AFA9EC;
    --purple-400: #7F77DD;
    --purple-600: #534AB7;
    --purple-800: #3C3489;
    --teal-50: #E1F5EE;
    --teal-400: #1D9E75;
    --teal-800: #085041;
    --amber-50: #FAEEDA;
    --amber-400: #EF9F27;
    --amber-800: #633806;
    --gray-50: #F8F8F6;
    --gray-100: #F0EFEB;
    --gray-200: #DDDBD4;
    --gray-400: #888780;
    --gray-700: #4A4947;
    --gray-900: #1C1C1A;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    background: var(--gray-50);
    color: var(--gray-900);
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 48px 24px 80px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .page { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }

  header { margin-bottom: 56px; }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gray-400);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--gray-900);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--gray-400);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .legend {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    border-radius: 8px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gray-700);
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .tag-vault { background: var(--teal-50); color: var(--teal-800); border: 1px solid #5DCAA5; }
  .tag-ask   { background: var(--amber-50); color: var(--amber-800); border: 1px solid var(--amber-400); }
  .tag-org   { background: var(--gray-100); color: var(--gray-700); border: 1px solid var(--gray-200); }

  .steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .step:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }

  .step::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 199px;
    top: 28px;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--gray-200);
  }

  .step:last-child::before { display: none; }

  .step-meta { padding-top: 2px; }

  .step-num {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--gray-400);
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--gray-900);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .step-why {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--gray-400);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .step-why em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--gray-700);
  }

  .panel {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .panel-header {
    padding: 9px 14px;
    background: var(--gray-100);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--gray-400);
  }

  .panel-body { padding: 12px 14px; }

  .domain-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .domain-chip {
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    background: var(--gray-50);
    color: var(--gray-400);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .domain-chip.active {
    background: var(--purple-50);
    border-color: var(--purple-200);
    color: var(--purple-800);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .tool-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-100);
  }

  .tool-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .tool-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--purple-50);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--purple-600);
  }

  .tool-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--gray-900);
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 5px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .tool-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--gray-400);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .cta-bar {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: var(--purple-50);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--purple-200);
  }

  .cta-bar-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--purple-800);
  }

  .vault-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    background: var(--purple-600);
    color: var(--purple-50);
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 2px 9px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-left: 2px;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 64px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--gray-400);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">Convert Marketing — Internal tooling concept</div>
    <h1>Domain Access Map</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A single entry point for new roleholders to understand what tools exist for their domain and how to get access — without tribal knowledge or manual handovers.</p>
    <div class="legend">
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="tag tag-vault">&#10003; In vault</span> Credentials in Bitwarden</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="tag tag-ask">&#9913; Ask role</span> API keys held by a named role</div>
      <div class="legend-item"><span class="tag tag-org">&#9679; Org login</span> SSO or org email, no handover needed</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="steps">

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-meta">
        <div class="step-num">Step 01</div>
        <div class="step-title">Select your domain</div>
        <div class="step-why">
          Domains — not roles — are the stable anchor. Roles shift person to person; domains stay consistent.<br><br>
          <em>A new roleholder doesn't need to know who held the role before them. The domain tile is the entry point.</em>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header">Marketing domains</div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <div class="domain-grid">
            <div class="domain-chip">YouTube: Longform</div>
            <div class="domain-chip">YouTube: Shorts</div>
            <div class="domain-chip active">Reddit</div>
            <div class="domain-chip">LinkedIn: Organic</div>
            <div class="domain-chip">LinkedIn: Ads</div>
            <div class="domain-chip">Substack</div>
            <div class="domain-chip">Google: SEO</div>
            <div class="domain-chip">Google: Ads</div>
            <div class="domain-chip">External Ambassadors</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-meta">
        <div class="step-num">Step 02</div>
        <div class="step-title">See the tool stack for that domain</div>
        <div class="step-why">
          Each tool is tagged with its access type so the roleholder knows exactly what action to take.<br><br>
          <em>Tools are multihomed across domains. This view shows only what's relevant, not the entire stack.</em>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header">Reddit — tool stack</div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <div class="tool-row">
            <div class="tool-icon">&#9711;</div>
            <div>
              <div class="tool-name">F5Bot <span class="tag tag-ask">&#9913; Ask Distribution Optimizer</span></div>
              <div class="tool-desc">Keyword alert monitoring — emails when your terms appear on Reddit</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-row">
            <div class="tool-icon">&#9650;</div>
            <div>
              <div class="tool-name">Reddit Pro <span class="tag tag-vault">&#10003; In vault</span></div>
              <div class="tool-desc">Reddit's business suite for analytics and promoted posts</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-row">
            <div class="tool-icon">&#9670;</div>
            <div>
              <div class="tool-name">Threadscout.ai <span class="tag tag-vault">&#10003; In vault</span></div>
              <div class="tool-desc">AI-powered Reddit thread discovery and engagement scoring</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-row">
            <div class="tool-icon">&#9632;</div>
            <div>
              <div class="tool-name">Reddit <span class="tag tag-vault">&#10003; In vault</span></div>
              <div class="tool-desc">Convert's branded Reddit account credentials</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-bar">
          <div class="cta-bar-text">Look for the <span class="vault-chip">Reddit vault</span> in Bitwarden</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-meta">
        <div class="step-num">Step 03</div>
        <div class="step-title">Get access via Bitwarden</div>
        <div class="step-why">
          Credentials are company-owned, not individual-owned. The system tells the roleholder which vault to find — no deep integration required.<br><br>
          <em>Role reassignment means vault access is reassigned, not rebuilt from scratch.</em>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header">Bitwarden Enterprise — Reddit vault</div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <div class="tool-row">
            <div class="tool-icon" style="background: var(--teal-50); color: var(--teal-400);">&#10003;</div>
            <div>
              <div class="tool-name">Reddit Pro</div>
              <div class="tool-desc">Login credentials — company account</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-row">
            <div class="tool-icon" style="background: var(--teal-50); color: var(--teal-400);">&#10003;</div>
            <div>
              <div class="tool-name">Threadscout.ai</div>
              <div class="tool-desc">Login credentials + API key</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-row">
            <div class="tool-icon" style="background: var(--teal-50); color: var(--teal-400);">&#10003;</div>
            <div>
              <div class="tool-name">Reddit</div>
              <div class="tool-desc">Branded account credentials</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-row">
            <div class="tool-icon" style="background: var(--amber-50); color: var(--amber-400);">&#9913;</div>
            <div>
              <div class="tool-name">F5Bot <span class="tag tag-ask">&#9913; Ask Distribution Optimizer</span></div>
              <div class="tool-desc">Not in vault — contact DO directly for alert configuration</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <footer>
    <span>Convert Marketing — Internal concept</span>
    <span>Domain Access Map v0.1</span>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
